      "id": 1,
      "prompt": "Find the area of a circle with radius $5$.",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "Use $A=\\pi r^2$.",
          "$A=\\pi(5)^2=25\\pi$.",
          "So the area is $25\\pi$ square units."
